|---|---:|---:|---:|
| system prompt | 10 | ≈1.0k | 51.8% |
| tool Artifact | 6 | ≈1.0k | 31.1% |
| tool Read | 9 | ≈100 | 5.7% |
| tool Bash | 10 | ≈100 | 5.2% |
| tool Workflow | 3 | ≈200 | 3.1% |
| tool Monitor | 4 | ≈100 | 2.1% |
| tool Grep | 2 | ≈100 | 1.0% |

## Paid for but unused

Unused cost of a tool = Σ over decomposed main sessions that carry it and never call it of its ≈tokens × N, as a share of all main token-turns (pooled). Calls, projects and last call count every eligible main session. At most 15 tools.

